worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_coding_idioms_and_text_manipulation.js"
  ceiling 1388
  rationale "The coding-idiom catalog that renders numeric-list programs, and the text-manipulation request parser and operations. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling 1220 (2026-10-07, R1017): text operations chain in the order the request names them (OperationVocabulary::position twin). Ceiling 1336 (2026-10-07, R1017): counting questions (a seeded counting cue plus a unit noun asked of the request framing outside its quoted payload, operationAsksCountOf), a seeded character-class count (countedCharacterClass) and the line filter-by-prefix operation with its phrase argument, twins of rust/src/solver_handlers/text_request_framing.rs, text_manipulation.rs and OperationVocabulary::asks_count_of / counted_character_class. Ceiling 1374 (2026-10-07, R1017): numericListStatedResult answers a list transformation asked without a language or code request with its computed result, twin of rust/src/solver_handlers/numeric_list/stated_result.rs. Ceiling 1392 (2026-10-07, PR #1188): namesFormatConversion — a format-conversion cue in the prose around the quoted literals makes tryTextManipulation and tryNumericList read the payload as data, mirroring text_manipulation::names_format_conversion in Rust. PR #1188 dogfooding (+1): a composed function also travels as `synthesizedProgram` so the agentic reroute can write and run it (attachExecutionRecipe, mirroring native attach_execution_recipe). PR #1188 T1 (+1): tryProgramSynthesis names the language it synthesized in (browserSynthesisLanguage) instead of always Python, so a JavaScript function is answered, fenced and handed to the reroute as JavaScript. Ceiling moved 1394 to 1396 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds. Ceiling lowered 1396 to 1388 (R1188-U29, 2026-10-09): the agent opt-in literals left for the agent-mode-opt-in-marker seed role, read by isAgentModeRequest in formal_ai_worker_policy_gates.js."
